# Pilger leader (lead = true): the same pilgrim as `pilger`, but his walking
# stick is taller and carries a small red-white-red pennant r/w above his hat
# (the group leader, like a tour guide's umbrella). The pennant flies back
# over his head, at most 8 rows above the hat; decoration only - the
# hitbox is the plain pilgrim's (rows 10-31). Same anims and poses as
# `pilger` (sprite moved down 8 rows). Faces right; mirror = auto.
sprite = pilger_lead
size   = 16x32
origin = 8,32
hitbox = 2,10,12,22
mirror = auto
anim   = walk     frames=2 ticks=12 loop
anim   = squished frames=1
